  <name>WhatsApp Desktop</name>
  <summary>Use WhatsApp Web with desktop notifications and a system tray</summary>
  <description>
    <p>An independent desktop client for WhatsApp Web with system tray integration,
    desktop notifications, themes, configurable fonts and privacy controls.</p>
    <p>It requires an existing WhatsApp account and an Internet connection.
    This project is not affiliated with Meta or WhatsApp.</p>
  </description>
  <developer id="io.github.seotarek">
    <name>Tarek (seotarek)</name>
  </developer>
